## Verification Contracting Mode

This feature verifies through automated tests only.

- Put every verification command — unit, integration, build, lint, and packaged end-to-end journeys — under `### Automated Verification`.
- `### Manual Verification`, `### Visual Evidence`, and `### Behavioral Evidence` must each contain exactly one item: `- [ ] None required: automated-only verification for this feature`.
